      "statement": "Inspect only facts.us-gaap concepts in this fixed order: Revenues, SalesRevenueNet, RevenueFromContractWithCustomerExcludingAssessedTax. Inspect only each units.USD array; absent concept/units/array contributes no facts. Never merge USD with shares or another unit.",
      "parameters": [],
      "claimIds": [],
      "sourceSpan": {
        "type": "ArtifactFabricationSourceSpan",
        "startLine": 5,
        "endLine": 5
      }
    },
    {
